                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/4590: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Second Secretary of Legation in Nicaragua</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Dermis</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-02-18T17:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">February 18,
                                1927—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 8:20 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>48. Minister went to Corinto today for conference tomorrow with Admiral
                    Latimer.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dennis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
